(3247897, 451183, 45519, '<td valign="top">Good detail, especially the match head, and a tough exposure to nail. The centered composition would have been better served with a square crop or more creative use of negative space and the flame being out-of-frame hurts this one a bit technically IMO.</td>', 'Good detail, especially the match head, and a tough exposure to nail. The centered composition would have been better served with a square crop or more creative use of negative space and the flame being out-of-frame hurts this one a bit technically IMO.', '2007-01-17 16:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
