(3247955, 452042, 26001, '<td valign="top">impressively clever! By the way, why is burnt side of the match is towards the colder side? am I missing any relationship between burnt-wood and minimum molecular energy (at 0 Rankine) level?  or it is just that the burnt-round-tip looks better inside the circular part? hehehe...in any case, 10 from be for this clever idea :)</td>', 'impressively clever! By the way, why is burnt side of the match is towards the colder side? am I missing any relationship between burnt-wood and minimum molecular energy (at 0 Rankine) level?  or it is just that the burnt-round-tip looks better inside the circular part? hehehe...in any case, 10 from be for this clever idea :)', '2007-01-17 16:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248036, 453879, 69388, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition, but I''m not a fan of the out of focus foreground</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition, but I''m not a fan of the out of focus foreground', '2007-01-17 16:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
