(3248225, 454205, 69388, '<td valign="top">It would be nicer without the noise</td>', 'It would be nicer without the noise', '2007-01-17 17:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248228, 451525, 45519, '<td valign="top">Well seen and beautifully executed.  The "match" part is a bit of a stretch, though the connection is there and the result is an outstanding abstract with great quality of light and a pleasing composition. *8*</td>', 'Well seen and beautifully executed.  The "match" part is a bit of a stretch, though the connection is there and the result is an outstanding abstract with great quality of light and a pleasing composition. *8*', '2007-01-17 17:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248243, 454225, 45519, '<td valign="top">Outstanding technical qualities here with terrific quality of light and superb composition ... this would make a great stock photo!  That said, it doesn''t readily speak to the theme without a title.  *7* (if only because the connection with the theme is missing for me)</td>', 'Outstanding technical qualities here with terrific quality of light and superb composition ... this would make a great stock photo!  That said, it doesn''t readily speak to the theme without a title.  *7* (if only because the connection with the theme is missing for me)', '2007-01-17 17:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248250, 454324, 45519, '<td valign="top">LOL.  With the attention to detail that clearly went into this, I can''t believe the label on the box is upside down to the viewer and the box prop visible underneath! ;-)  *8* for creativity</td>', 'LOL.  With the attention to detail that clearly went into this, I can''t believe the label on the box is upside down to the viewer and the box prop visible underneath! ;-)  *8* for creativity', '2007-01-17 17:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248254, 453469, 45519, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well executed.  The only critique I have is that the match heads are a bit soft; this image would really pop if they were sharper.  Still, a pleasing image.  *8*</td>', 'Very creative and well executed.  The only critique I have is that the match heads are a bit soft; this image would really pop if they were sharper.  Still, a pleasing image.  *8*', '2007-01-17 17:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248260, 453760, 45519, '<td valign="top">I think your tripod tipped over!  ;-)  That''s a big match.</td>', 'I think your tripod tipped over!  ;-)  That''s a big match.', '2007-01-17 17:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248270, 454218, 45519, '<td valign="top">Good concept and successful use of DOF, with a pleasing quality of light and b&amp;w treatment as well.  When scoring this one, however, I''m put off a bit with the composition which is too tight along the bottom of the right show (as viewed) and the shoestrings haphazardly going out of frame. *6*</td>', 'Good concept and successful use of DOF, with a pleasing quality of light and b&w treatment as well.  When scoring this one, however, I''m put off a bit with the composition which is too tight along the bottom of the right show (as viewed) and the shoestrings haphazardly going out of frame. *6*', '2007-01-17 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248281, 453553, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nice quality of light and great concept, with the wedding bands set against a corresponding matchbook from the wedding ... two (or three - gold bands, marriage/couple implied, and matchbook) matches in one scene. :)  It''d be nice to see just a tick more of the matches peaking out from the matchbook and composition could be stronger.</td>', 'Nice quality of light and great concept, with the wedding bands set against a corresponding matchbook from the wedding ... two (or three - gold bands, marriage/couple implied, and matchbook) matches in one scene. :)  It''d be nice to see just a tick more of the matches peaking out from the matchbook and composition could be stronger.', '2007-01-17 17:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248288, 452808, 45519, '<td valign="top">The layout/composition and subject are standout, but I''m not hot on the processing ... it looks like a photo of something on TV.  I''m all for creative license and going beyond basic "stock photography" type shots, I just don''t see a correlation between the treatment (assuming it isn''t actually a photo of something on screen) and the challenge topic.</td>', 'The layout/composition and subject are standout, but I''m not hot on the processing ... it looks like a photo of something on TV.  I''m all for creative license and going beyond basic "stock photography" type shots, I just don''t see a correlation between the treatment (assuming it isn''t actually a photo of something on screen) and the challenge topic.', '2007-01-17 17:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248289, 454321, 45519, '<td valign="top">Observation: The splash of red in the upper corner keeps drawing my eye away from the primary subject(s).</td>', 'Observation: The splash of red in the upper corner keeps drawing my eye away from the primary subject(s).', '2007-01-17 17:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248303, 454125, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Only criticism -- and likely out of your control -- is that the flame goes outside the frame ... this would be a 10 if the match were further left in the composition and the flame fully captured, but otherwise exactly as seen here.  *8*</td>', 'Nicely done.  Only criticism -- and likely out of your control -- is that the flame goes outside the frame ... this would be a 10 if the match were further left in the composition and the flame fully captured, but otherwise exactly as seen here.  *8*', '2007-01-17 17:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248322, 451223, 45519, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture with great technical qualities ... and nicely processed. The only thing that detracts from this in any way is the red dot in the rightmost mallard''s reflection. *9*</td>', 'Wonderful capture with great technical qualities ... and nicely processed. The only thing that detracts from this in any way is the red dot in the rightmost mallard''s reflection. *9*', '2007-01-17 17:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248332, 454326, 45519, '<td valign="top">Very cool match-behind-a-match capture. If I had to nitpick this one it''d be limited to the rear match head being slightly visible right of the foreground match ... otherwise, well executed.  *8*</td>', 'Very cool match-behind-a-match capture. If I had to nitpick this one it''d be limited to the rear match head being slightly visible right of the foreground match ... otherwise, well executed.  *8*', '2007-01-17 17:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248338, 453672, 45519, '<td valign="top">LOL ... very creative.  *8*</td>', 'LOL ... very creative.  *8*', '2007-01-17 17:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248347, 453836, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured ... great composition.  The blown highlights in the flam work here and the fire pattern give a great sens of striking the match, further reinforced by the message on the box.  *8*</td>', 'Nicely captured ... great composition.  The blown highlights in the flam work here and the fire pattern give a great sens of striking the match, further reinforced by the message on the box.  *8*', '2007-01-17 18:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248353, 454186, 45519, '<td valign="top">Well done</td>', 'Well done', '2007-01-17 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248381, 453959, 62318, '<td valign="top">Even though it is a studio type shot (aka very controlled), I like what you were doing here. An ingenious idea. Exposure is terrific. One of my highest rated for the challenge.</td>', 'Even though it is a studio type shot (aka very controlled), I like what you were doing here. An ingenious idea. Exposure is terrific. One of my highest rated for the challenge.', '2007-01-17 18:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248382, 450925, 70164, '<td valign="top">The "mom" is a bit dark, good idea tho.</td>', 'The "mom" is a bit dark, good idea tho.', '2007-01-17 18:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248384, 452864, 70164, '<td valign="top">Good capture.</td>', 'Good capture.', '2007-01-17 18:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248388, 452716, 70164, '<td valign="top">Oooo, I like that, its so evil, haha. I like your setup. 8</td>', 'Oooo, I like that, its so evil, haha. I like your setup. 8', '2007-01-17 18:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3248389, 452646, 62318, '<td valign="top">You could have easily been in Panning also, but this is great. Love the detail on the Matchbox cars and like what you did with the background. One of my highest rated for the challenge. Terrific.</td>', 'You could have easily been in Panning also, but this is great. Love the detail on the Matchbox cars and like what you did with the background. One of my highest rated for the challenge. Terrific.', '2007-01-17 18:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
