(3252695, 453773, 53316, '<td valign="top">Living across from one of these cemeteries I know it is incredibly hard to get a well-composed shot... I do think the composition is the biggest downfall of this shot as it seems very unbalanced.  One thing to do is the stone that is in the foreground, maybe could have been at a straight-on angle to the camera, so that the shot felt more balanced, and then you could perhaps crop off the bottom so that the partial stone is not visible, and a tiny bit of a tighter crop at the top would have eliminated the bit of clutteredness up there.</td>', 'Living across from one of these cemeteries I know it is incredibly hard to get a well-composed shot... I do think the composition is the biggest downfall of this shot as it seems very unbalanced.  One thing to do is the stone that is in the foreground, maybe could have been at a straight-on angle to the camera, so that the shot felt more balanced, and then you could perhaps crop off the bottom so that the partial stone is not visible, and a tiny bit of a tighter crop at the top would have eliminated the bit of clutteredness up there.', '2007-01-18 18:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
