(3253710, 453348, 32338, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity of the front subject.  And nice crop.  But, what is the colorful thing in the background and what is monumental about lighting a match?  I''m still trying to figure this out....  Oh, now I get it - lots of candles on the birthday cake.  Nice.  For the sake of your score, I hope that others understand faster than I did.  8</td>', 'I like the clarity of the front subject.  And nice crop.  But, what is the colorful thing in the background and what is monumental about lighting a match?  I''m still trying to figure this out....  Oh, now I get it - lots of candles on the birthday cake.  Nice.  For the sake of your score, I hope that others understand faster than I did.  8', '2007-01-18 22:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3253866, 453633, 68573, '<td valign="top">Very creative indeed. The one on the right is a girl i guess :-) can see the hair style difference</td>', 'Very creative indeed. The one on the right is a girl i guess :-) can see the hair style difference', '2007-01-18 23:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
