(3253879, 453679, 68573, '<td valign="top">Hahaha nice setup here</td>', 'Hahaha nice setup here', '2007-01-18 23:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3253893, 453089, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice thought and a good execution. Your focus seems to be n the left side match heads which i think makes this a little weak. I think it would have been beetter to focus on the captive or on the bras in front of its face. Anyways thats my opinion it looks good like this too</td>', 'Nice thought and a good execution. Your focus seems to be n the left side match heads which i think makes this a little weak. I think it would have been beetter to focus on the captive or on the bras in front of its face. Anyways thats my opinion it looks good like this too', '2007-01-18 23:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3253905, 452993, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but i didnt like the execution. I think the choice of the plate is not right. The pattern on the plate distracts from the central pattern and so does the translucent nature of the plate. Good try though</td>', 'Nice concept but i didnt like the execution. I think the choice of the plate is not right. The pattern on the plate distracts from the central pattern and so does the translucent nature of the plate. Good try though', '2007-01-18 23:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3253912, 454120, 68573, '<td valign="top">has a retro feel to it and yes its a nice capture. like that</td>', 'has a retro feel to it and yes its a nice capture. like that', '2007-01-18 23:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3253928, 453222, 68573, '<td valign="top">wow - what a setup. You seem to have put in so much effort and yes it looks like worth it. Very nice and absolutely creative. The spectators in the background are large enough so it seems like an important match :). I think you may have made it look still better by turning the player a bit more so that the racquet was more visible. The concept of the movong ball is just brilliant</td>', 'wow - what a setup. You seem to have put in so much effort and yes it looks like worth it. Very nice and absolutely creative. The spectators in the background are large enough so it seems like an important match :). I think you may have made it look still better by turning the player a bit more so that the racquet was more visible. The concept of the movong ball is just brilliant', '2007-01-18 23:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3253935, 453902, 68573, '<td valign="top">a very nice composition. like the colors of the sky and the calmness in the picture. on the lighter side i did notice that the Death is wearing a nice nail paint, a freindly death i guess- lol. Nice concept - 7</td>', 'a very nice composition. like the colors of the sky and the calmness in the picture. on the lighter side i did notice that the Death is wearing a nice nail paint, a freindly death i guess- lol. Nice concept - 7', '2007-01-18 23:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
