(3254515, 452567, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, not easy to make this type of picture (7)</td>', 'Nice action shot, not easy to make this type of picture (7)', '2007-01-19 03:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3254520, 452945, 70689, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at quite some pix of matches by now, this one is a very nice one. I like the sharpness and the lighting, as well as gthe way you caught the flame. Most of all, I love the subtle black-on-black in the picture. (9)</td>', 'I''ve been looking at quite some pix of matches by now, this one is a very nice one. I like the sharpness and the lighting, as well as gthe way you caught the flame. Most of all, I love the subtle black-on-black in the picture. (9)', '2007-01-19 03:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3254525, 454205, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am sorry, but the unnatural colour of the strawberry realy puts me of. (4)</td>', 'I am sorry, but the unnatural colour of the strawberry realy puts me of. (4)', '2007-01-19 03:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3254538, 454024, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but in this case ''less'' would realy have been ''more''. The number of pieces on the board is higher than needed for a check mate. What''s worse, the picture becomes a bit too busy because of the high number of pieces. (5)</td>', 'I like the idea, but in this case ''less'' would realy have been ''more''. The number of pieces on the board is higher than needed for a check mate. What''s worse, the picture becomes a bit too busy because of the high number of pieces. (5)', '2007-01-19 03:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3254553, 453222, 70689, '<td valign="top">Funny. Good IQ as well (7)</td>', 'Funny. Good IQ as well (7)', '2007-01-19 03:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3254558, 453130, 70689, '<td valign="top">I realy like the idea of this picture, especially the way you use something seemingly irrelevant (the first attempt) to strengthen the meaning of the picture without making it too obvious. Great thinking there! I also like the dramatinc lighting, too bad you did not captire the entire shadow at the bootom of the picture. Nevertheless: 9</td>', 'I realy like the idea of this picture, especially the way you use something seemingly irrelevant (the first attempt) to strengthen the meaning of the picture without making it too obvious. Great thinking there! I also like the dramatinc lighting, too bad you did not captire the entire shadow at the bootom of the picture. Nevertheless: 9', '2007-01-19 03:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3254566, 454333, 70689, '<td valign="top">Didn''t you get any sexual education? Babies are not made in heaven, more likely in bed, or well, anywhere you like. But serious: The image quality is fine, I like the bw-conversion as well as the lighting and the composition. But the interpretation of the theme is a bit too sugary to my taste. (7)</td>', 'Didn''t you get any sexual education? Babies are not made in heaven, more likely in bed, or well, anywhere you like. But serious: The image quality is fine, I like the bw-conversion as well as the lighting and the composition. But the interpretation of the theme is a bit too sugary to my taste. (7)', '2007-01-19 03:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3254568, 454196, 70689, '<td valign="top">Funny. (7)</td>', 'Funny. (7)', '2007-01-19 03:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3254626, 453562, 69333, '<td valign="top">Very busy, maybe a tighter crop, and the reflection of the window is very distracting.</td>', 'Very busy, maybe a tighter crop, and the reflection of the window is very distracting.', '2007-01-19 04:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
