(3254658, 454125, 68573, '<td valign="top">One of the best flare shots in this challenge. The angular burn is amazing as well as a great smoke surrounding the flame. I wonder how u captured this angular burn - many tries??</td>', 'One of the best flare shots in this challenge. The angular burn is amazing as well as a great smoke surrounding the flame. I wonder how u captured this angular burn - many tries??', '2007-01-19 05:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
