(3255977, 452716, 70375, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness! I sure hope you are okay. I would like to have seen what happened when that middle one burned down to hit the others ;) Nice capture of the flame here, beautiful colours with the red and yellow. The black in the background makes a nice statement too ;)</td>', 'Oh my goodness! I sure hope you are okay. I would like to have seen what happened when that middle one burned down to hit the others ;) Nice capture of the flame here, beautiful colours with the red and yellow. The black in the background makes a nice statement too ;)', '2007-01-19 14:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256002, 454334, 57260, '<td valign="top">OMG I had the EXACT same idea for this challenge but ran out of time before I could submit! Well executed. 10 for using my idea.</td>', 'OMG I had the EXACT same idea for this challenge but ran out of time before I could submit! Well executed. 10 for using my idea.', '2007-01-19 14:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256034, 453730, 42869, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see the crop the other direction so you could fully see both hands and the eyes behind.  The lower 1/3 of the picture detracts from the hands themselves.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see the crop the other direction so you could fully see both hands and the eyes behind.  The lower 1/3 of the picture detracts from the hands themselves.', '2007-01-19 14:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256044, 452880, 42869, '<td valign="top">The match is not well enough lit to really make it show up - I''m guessing the metering of your camera exposed for the flames, making the match area so dark.  The composition is also neither centered nor follows the "rule of thirds".  Either even spacing top to bottom or a different crop (a square crop would have been great here) would make the image feel more complete.</td>', 'The match is not well enough lit to really make it show up - I''m guessing the metering of your camera exposed for the flames, making the match area so dark.  The composition is also neither centered nor follows the "rule of thirds".  Either even spacing top to bottom or a different crop (a square crop would have been great here) would make the image feel more complete.', '2007-01-19 14:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256046, 454281, 42869, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more light on this to make the colors stand out more.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more light on this to make the colors stand out more.', '2007-01-19 14:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256047, 454120, 42869, '<td valign="top">Very sharp capture and nice use of wide angle.</td>', 'Very sharp capture and nice use of wide angle.', '2007-01-19 14:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256052, 453900, 42869, '<td valign="top">I feel there is too much going on here - too many things to distract the eye.  I feel like I''m looking at one of the books by Grame Base where you try and find the hidden objects throughout.</td>', 'I feel there is too much going on here - too many things to distract the eye.  I feel like I''m looking at one of the books by Grame Base where you try and find the hidden objects throughout.', '2007-01-19 14:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256062, 453702, 42869, '<td valign="top">Good use of ''rule of thirds'' and filling the frame with your subject. The color is good but the subject isn''t that interesting.  The light from the flame overwhelms the photo leaving very little detail anywhere else.</td>', 'Good use of ''rule of thirds'' and filling the frame with your subject. The color is good but the subject isn''t that interesting.  The light from the flame overwhelms the photo leaving very little detail anywhere else.', '2007-01-19 14:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256072, 453855, 42869, '<td valign="top">Focus is too soft, better lighting would have made for more interesting colors.</td>', 'Focus is too soft, better lighting would have made for more interesting colors.', '2007-01-19 14:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256075, 453089, 42869, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I would have recommended a deeper DOF so the matches at the front were in sharp focus as well.</td>', 'Good idea.  I would have recommended a deeper DOF so the matches at the front were in sharp focus as well.', '2007-01-19 14:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256082, 453189, 42869, '<td valign="top">Having taken ''dice in motion'' shots before, I know how challenging it is to get them captured.  This is nicely done - would have liked to see a little sharper focus, but then again, tough shot.</td>', 'Having taken ''dice in motion'' shots before, I know how challenging it is to get them captured.  This is nicely done - would have liked to see a little sharper focus, but then again, tough shot.', '2007-01-19 14:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3256092, 453158, 42869, '<td valign="top">Oh man - if the blinds wouldn''t have been visible in the background, this would be a GREAT image.  As it stands, it''s very good but I find the blinds too much of a distraction.</td>', 'Oh man - if the blinds wouldn''t have been visible in the background, this would be a GREAT image.  As it stands, it''s very good but I find the blinds too much of a distraction.', '2007-01-19 14:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
