(3257404, 453759, 66952, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh, yes! An original idea! Finally! Really, I like the idea. Things I would look to improve...I think the shot would be more effective if the undies were a little sharper. I can''t tell if it was out of focus, or if there''s camera shake from shooting handheld in low light, but it just isn''t quite sharp. Also, maybe pay attention a little more to the mood created by the lighting. It looks like you just blasted the subject with a bright light. A little softer, more directional lighting would be more effective. Think about what the lighting might be when the undies are leading up a flight of stairs, and you have the idea. But great idea. Keep it up!</td>', 'Ahhhh, yes! An original idea! Finally! Really, I like the idea. Things I would look to improve...I think the shot would be more effective if the undies were a little sharper. I can''t tell if it was out of focus, or if there''s camera shake from shooting handheld in low light, but it just isn''t quite sharp. Also, maybe pay attention a little more to the mood created by the lighting. It looks like you just blasted the subject with a bright light. A little softer, more directional lighting would be more effective. Think about what the lighting might be when the undies are leading up a flight of stairs, and you have the idea. But great idea. Keep it up!', '2007-01-19 19:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3257503, 453960, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hmm. I think, to me.. she''s not angry or worried looking enough to really match the environment. But I do like the concept.  Composition and colors are good as well.</td>', 'Hmm. I think, to me.. she''s not angry or worried looking enough to really match the environment. But I do like the concept.  Composition and colors are good as well.', '2007-01-19 20:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
