(3257991, 454334, 6519, '<td valign="top">It is such a shame about the dust (?) spots on the glass, it spoils the otherwise awesome effect. I still love it, though, and admire the imagination. Super idea!!!</td>', 'It is such a shame about the dust (?) spots on the glass, it spoils the otherwise awesome effect. I still love it, though, and admire the imagination. Super idea!!!', '2007-01-19 22:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
