(3258021, 451324, 18367, '<td valign="top">Removing the wrinkles in the backdrop would have helped immensely in this instance.  As it stands, the image would seem to suggest that you paid scant attention to details.</td>', 'Removing the wrinkles in the backdrop would have helped immensely in this instance.  As it stands, the image would seem to suggest that you paid scant attention to details.', '2007-01-19 22:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
