(3258156, 454131, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m not overly fond of the lighting or the white balance, but I love the idea with the glass/mirror.</td>', 'I''m not overly fond of the lighting or the white balance, but I love the idea with the glass/mirror.', '2007-01-19 23:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258170, 453727, 6519, '<td valign="top">Quite brilliant - can''t wait to read how that was done. The corners don''t look perfectly even, so I''m thinking they were actually hand made ... hmmmm.... good puzzle for us  :-)</td>', 'Quite brilliant - can''t wait to read how that was done. The corners don''t look perfectly even, so I''m thinking they were actually hand made ... hmmmm.... good puzzle for us  :-)', '2007-01-19 23:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258173, 453190, 6519, '<td valign="top">A thoroughly charming portrait. Colors, lighting, background, clothes.... it all comes together very well!</td>', 'A thoroughly charming portrait. Colors, lighting, background, clothes.... it all comes together very well!', '2007-01-19 23:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258309, 451014, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you 3 points for showing a match (so it fits the challenge) and one for the head being in focus. Other than that, I can''t find anything positive to say about this. The composition is static and boring, the white balance is off, and there is nothing at all to hold my interest.</td>', 'I''m giving you 3 points for showing a match (so it fits the challenge) and one for the head being in focus. Other than that, I can''t find anything positive to say about this. The composition is static and boring, the white balance is off, and there is nothing at all to hold my interest.', '2007-01-19 23:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258321, 453611, 6519, '<td valign="top">I guess some people would say this photo is cliche, eye-candy, perhaps even "Kitsch" - but I don''t care. <br/>I think it is very beautiful in a timeless way. You did a wonderful job with the technicalities and really pulled it off. Love it.</td>', 'I guess some people would say this photo is cliche, eye-candy, perhaps even "Kitsch" - but I don''t care. I think it is very beautiful in a timeless way. You did a wonderful job with the technicalities and really pulled it off. Love it.', '2007-01-20 00:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258340, 453222, 6519, '<td valign="top">Very clever! It''s a cute idea and looks great. The only change I would make is to turn the "player" clockwise just a touch more but I''m sure you had your reasons why you didn''t (perhaps the racquet didn''t turn out good enough?)<br/> <br/>The clear focus on the ball and player are a wonderful contrast from the background.</td>', 'Very clever! It''s a cute idea and looks great. The only change I would make is to turn the "player" clockwise just a touch more but I''m sure you had your reasons why you didn''t (perhaps the racquet didn''t turn out good enough?) The clear focus on the ball and player are a wonderful contrast from the background.', '2007-01-20 00:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258431, 453691, 65438, '<td valign="top">Great color, but I think I would have liked it more if the match was positioned on the left with more of the colorful smoke drifting across the entire shot.  Gave it an 8.</td>', 'Great color, but I think I would have liked it more if the match was positioned on the left with more of the colorful smoke drifting across the entire shot.  Gave it an 8.', '2007-01-20 00:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258470, 453726, 15511, '<td valign="top">A leeetle more sharpening. Have you seen the progam "Focus Magic?"<br/>I like the composition, seems tilted a little to the left.</td>', 'A leeetle more sharpening. Have you seen the progam "Focus Magic?"I like the composition, seems tilted a little to the left.', '2007-01-20 01:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258651, 454120, 67258, '<td valign="top">Stop rubbing salt into our wounds!...<br/>Superb photo - you have caught the atmosphere wonderfully.</td>', 'Stop rubbing salt into our wounds!...Superb photo - you have caught the atmosphere wonderfully.', '2007-01-20 02:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258734, 452957, 68573, '<td valign="top">Very nice work here. I love the way the matches are stacked and the colors are brilliant</td>', 'Very nice work here. I love the way the matches are stacked and the colors are brilliant', '2007-01-20 05:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258742, 454186, 46336, '<td valign="top">Similar to what I tried to execute, but far superior. I love the ''flow'' of the lines in your image. Well done.</td>', 'Similar to what I tried to execute, but far superior. I love the ''flow'' of the lines in your image. Well done.', '2007-01-20 05:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258747, 453190, 31443, '<td valign="top">Maybe a littl too soft but such a sweet image, love it!</td>', 'Maybe a littl too soft but such a sweet image, love it!', '2007-01-20 05:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258752, 452846, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but i am not able to relate it to the theme . Is it the pose of both the people ?</td>', 'Nice capture but i am not able to relate it to the theme . Is it the pose of both the people ?', '2007-01-20 05:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258758, 452653, 68573, '<td valign="top">Very creative indeed, the colors signify a lot of match here and its a wonderful image. I wonder if everyone can see this match - best of luck</td>', 'Very creative indeed, the colors signify a lot of match here and its a wonderful image. I wonder if everyone can see this match - best of luck', '2007-01-20 06:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258760, 453882, 68573, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture here. very nice composition. hmm.. like everything about it i guess so cant point out one partucular aspect</td>', 'Wonderful capture here. very nice composition. hmm.. like everything about it i guess so cant point out one partucular aspect', '2007-01-20 06:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258763, 453285, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the the diffused and understated look here.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the the diffused and understated look here.', '2007-01-20 06:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258770, 450925, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. Atleast someis thinking beyaond the literal matches. Great</td>', 'Nice concept. Atleast someis thinking beyaond the literal matches. Great', '2007-01-20 06:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258773, 452042, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice creative execution of the theme</td>', 'Nice creative execution of the theme', '2007-01-20 06:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258777, 453189, 68573, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Like the trails and the sharpness</td>', 'Very nice capture. Like the trails and the sharpness', '2007-01-20 06:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258780, 454335, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice lil magic up there</td>', 'Nice lil magic up there', '2007-01-20 06:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3258783, 453960, 68573, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt to do something different. You thought behind the image are nice and so is the capture. Subtlity of the subject makes the difference between a technically perfect picture and the perfectly ''connecting'' picture ( not that your picture has any technical flaw but there are many which are equally good or better technically) To me it''s one of the best shots in the challenge. Good luck</td>', 'I like the attempt to do something different. You thought behind the image are nice and so is the capture. Subtlity of the subject makes the difference between a technically perfect picture and the perfectly ''connecting'' picture ( not that your picture has any technical flaw but there are many which are equally good or better technically) To me it''s one of the best shots in the challenge. Good luck', '2007-01-20 06:33:58.000000', NULL, 1);
