(3262850, 453997, 72577, '<td valign="top">I liked the way you stepped out of the box.  I really like the sepia tone also.  I suppose only women would notice that she has nylons on thus ruining the illusion.  Great texture with the floor and the item behind her.</td>', 'I liked the way you stepped out of the box.  I really like the sepia tone also.  I suppose only women would notice that she has nylons on thus ruining the illusion.  Great texture with the floor and the item behind her.', '2007-01-21 17:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
