(3262872, 453761, 72577, '<td valign="top">Fantastic choice of lighting!  Brilliant!  I wish the depth of field was deeper so the salt was clearer.  The Constrast between the purple and green is amazing - it would have been nice to see the same contrast bewteen the salt and pepper.</td>', 'Fantastic choice of lighting!  Brilliant!  I wish the depth of field was deeper so the salt was clearer.  The Constrast between the purple and green is amazing - it would have been nice to see the same contrast bewteen the salt and pepper.', '2007-01-21 17:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262900, 453759, 59442, '<td valign="top">I love the concept~</td>', 'I love the concept~', '2007-01-21 17:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3262975, 453902, 66952, '<td valign="top">hmmmm...different. I love when people try different ideas, so thumbs up! It definitely meets the challenge, I''m just not sure I understand the theme. Technically, it looks good, except the light (from a flash, I assume) is a different color than the sunlight, which looks a bit awkward. You might want to use a colored gel on the flash to get it to match the color of the sun.</td>', 'hmmmm...different. I love when people try different ideas, so thumbs up! It definitely meets the challenge, I''m just not sure I understand the theme. Technically, it looks good, except the light (from a flash, I assume) is a different color than the sunlight, which looks a bit awkward. You might want to use a colored gel on the flash to get it to match the color of the sun.', '2007-01-21 17:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3263023, 454227, 66952, '<td valign="top">No, it should be mis-matched pear!</td>', 'No, it should be mis-matched pear!', '2007-01-21 18:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
