(3270439, 452716, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has potential.  Certainly ''Playing With Fire'' here...if that pile of matches underneath gets sparked!!!  Yikes!  There are a couple of technical glitches holding this image back.  First, it''s blurry like there was some movement of the camera.  Second, the flame is overexposed and blown out (fire is tricky to expose correctly for sure).  Overall, I like the concept.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This has potential.  Certainly ''Playing With Fire'' here...if that pile of matches underneath gets sparked!!!  Yikes!  There are a couple of technical glitches holding this image back.  First, it''s blurry like there was some movement of the camera.  Second, the flame is overexposed and blown out (fire is tricky to expose correctly for sure).  Overall, I like the concept.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-23 10:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270448, 452972, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this.  Nicely composed and well balanced.  You handled the extreme lighting quite well and it adds to the image in a positive manner. Too bad about the namebrand showing on one of them as this would make a decent stock shot (guess you could clone the logo out).  Good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the feel of this.  Nicely composed and well balanced.  You handled the extreme lighting quite well and it adds to the image in a positive manner. Too bad about the namebrand showing on one of them as this would make a decent stock shot (guess you could clone the logo out).  Good luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-01-23 10:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270451, 454262, 30049, '<td valign="top">Umm...you forgot to crop the top and left of this.  :D</td>', 'Umm...you forgot to crop the top and left of this.  :D', '2007-01-23 10:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270507, 454327, 66952, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and lit.</td>', 'Nicely composed and lit.', '2007-01-23 10:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270511, 453222, 66952, '<td valign="top">Oh, my gawd! What a lot of work!</td>', 'Oh, my gawd! What a lot of work!', '2007-01-23 10:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
