(3270810, 454249, 52549, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2007-01-23 12:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270817, 454042, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is just toooo cool! LMAO! Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'This is just toooo cool! LMAO! Hope it does well for you.', '2007-01-23 12:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270826, 454186, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2007-01-23 12:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270833, 454026, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great idea, super lighting and sharpness.</td>', 'Great idea, super lighting and sharpness.', '2007-01-23 12:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271026, 453081, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Now I''ve seen my fair share of matchsticks, smoke, multiple flame shots in this challenge.  I have to say that this is the most enticing thus far, of course I still have 100+ to go yet.  :D  I really like the way you composed this and the exposure and use of light on the smoke is outstanding.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Ok.  Now I''ve seen my fair share of matchsticks, smoke, multiple flame shots in this challenge.  I have to say that this is the most enticing thus far, of course I still have 100+ to go yet.  :D  I really like the way you composed this and the exposure and use of light on the smoke is outstanding.  Nicely done.', '2007-01-23 13:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271044, 453934, 30049, '<td valign="top">I get the impression you were going for a spotlight effect?  That would probably work well with this subject, but the lighting you used seems a little harsh, perhaps if you diffused it some...?  Another thing to consider is the ISO setting on your camera.  There is a lot of noise in this photo when really there shouldn''t be for this kind of setup.  JMO of course.  :D  The subject you picked has potential as this pair of shoes has character.  A little more attention to detail and your score would probably climb on this considerably.  Anyway...best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I get the impression you were going for a spotlight effect?  That would probably work well with this subject, but the lighting you used seems a little harsh, perhaps if you diffused it some...?  Another thing to consider is the ISO setting on your camera.  There is a lot of noise in this photo when really there shouldn''t be for this kind of setup.  JMO of course.  :D  The subject you picked has potential as this pair of shoes has character.  A little more attention to detail and your score would probably climb on this considerably.  Anyway...best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-01-23 14:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271053, 454065, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know what your shutter speed was.  Whatever it was, it wasn''t enough to catch that cute tail!  :D  Just kidding.  I think that tail blur brings this photo alive for the viewer.  Without the blur it would be a cute shot.  With the blur it makes you smile.  Nicely seen and captured.  The B/W treatment was a good choice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''d love to know what your shutter speed was.  Whatever it was, it wasn''t enough to catch that cute tail!  :D  Just kidding.  I think that tail blur brings this photo alive for the viewer.  Without the blur it would be a cute shot.  With the blur it makes you smile.  Nicely seen and captured.  The B/W treatment was a good choice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-23 14:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271335, 454205, 31341, '<td valign="top">You have that right!</td>', 'You have that right!', '2007-01-23 15:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271340, 452610, 31341, '<td valign="top">Nice work.</td>', 'Nice work.', '2007-01-23 15:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
