(3271702, 454026, 70369, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge. I think a lighter background would have made it "pop", regardless of that, it''s awesome.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge. I think a lighter background would have made it "pop", regardless of that, it''s awesome.', '2007-01-23 17:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271783, 454300, 70369, '<td valign="top">clever.. I like it.</td>', 'clever.. I like it.', '2007-01-23 17:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272042, 454338, 30049, '<td valign="top">Some pretty fine details here.  Amazing what things look like up close sometimes.  :D  This is certainly interesting to look at.  Too bad about that straggling hair up top.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Some pretty fine details here.  Amazing what things look like up close sometimes.  :D  This is certainly interesting to look at.  Too bad about that straggling hair up top.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-23 18:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272047, 453675, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one.  If you''re going to enter a shot that you (should) know is going to be well represented, it helps to take a unique approach.  If not, the photo needs to be crisp and clean.  This is a little bit too noisy/grainy to hit even an average score I''m afraid.  All JMO of course.  Good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a tough one.  If you''re going to enter a shot that you (should) know is going to be well represented, it helps to take a unique approach.  If not, the photo needs to be crisp and clean.  This is a little bit too noisy/grainy to hit even an average score I''m afraid.  All JMO of course.  Good luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-01-23 18:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272051, 453611, 30049, '<td valign="top">Now that is some sweetness!  Very clean and crisp, yet detailed and not NI''d to death.  Lovely composition and very well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Now that is some sweetness!  Very clean and crisp, yet detailed and not NI''d to death.  Lovely composition and very well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-23 18:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272144, 453605, 34938, '<td valign="top">I really like the creativity and the shadows on this...good work</td>', 'I really like the creativity and the shadows on this...good work', '2007-01-23 19:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272158, 454324, 34938, '<td valign="top">great creativity and fun...well done</td>', 'great creativity and fun...well done', '2007-01-23 19:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
