(3273553, 454016, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good clarity on the colored yarn.  Don''t really understand the title or how this is a match, though, which probably hurt your score somewhat.<br/> <br/>As a photo on its own, though, I like the lines and the diagonal of the colored yarn.  It reminds me of a sampler from my wife''s ancestor.  With a brightly-colored frame to contrast with the muted tones, it''d probably look pretty nice. :)</td>', 'Good clarity on the colored yarn.  Don''t really understand the title or how this is a match, though, which probably hurt your score somewhat. As a photo on its own, though, I like the lines and the diagonal of the colored yarn.  It reminds me of a sampler from my wife''s ancestor.  With a brightly-colored frame to contrast with the muted tones, it''d probably look pretty nice. :)', '2007-01-24 00:59:44.000000', NULL, 0),
