(3275477, 453959, 19978, '<td valign="top">This shot is a perfect example of the type of out-of-the box thinking that I wish I could do. You''re absolutely right that plenty of people would think of capturing a dramatic match-flare, but those would be too hum-drum to do well in this challenge. Bravo to you for coming up with a great idea and executing it perfectly!</td>', 'This shot is a perfect example of the type of out-of-the box thinking that I wish I could do. You''re absolutely right that plenty of people would think of capturing a dramatic match-flare, but those would be too hum-drum to do well in this challenge. Bravo to you for coming up with a great idea and executing it perfectly!', '2007-01-24 12:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
