(3275530, 452704, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, I cannot believe that people would vote this a 1 or a 2!  I don''t believe that any picture except one that does not meet challenge criteria deserves a 1 or a 2!  Unless it is completely out of focus, or a suspected "cheat" that anyone deserves that low.  And, on top of that the ones who vote 3''s, PLEASE leave a comment as to WHY you are voting that low!  It takes a lot of time and effort and thought to try to set up a shot.  Unless it''s a "snapshot" look to it, or totally out of focus, why does something obviously "set up" deserve a 3???? <br/> <br/>Ok, vented......got that out of my system! *smile*<br/> <br/>Thanks for all who took the time to vote.</td>', 'Wow, I cannot believe that people would vote this a 1 or a 2!  I don''t believe that any picture except one that does not meet challenge criteria deserves a 1 or a 2!  Unless it is completely out of focus, or a suspected "cheat" that anyone deserves that low.  And, on top of that the ones who vote 3''s, PLEASE leave a comment as to WHY you are voting that low!  It takes a lot of time and effort and thought to try to set up a shot.  Unless it''s a "snapshot" look to it, or totally out of focus, why does something obviously "set up" deserve a 3????  Ok, vented......got that out of my system! *smile* Thanks for all who took the time to vote.', '2007-01-24 12:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
