(3275584, 452653, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''d crop the clouds at the top - they bound the picture nicely, in my opinion.  Silhouetting is lovely and a nice glimpse of the comet!</td>', 'I don''t think I''d crop the clouds at the top - they bound the picture nicely, in my opinion.  Silhouetting is lovely and a nice glimpse of the comet!', '2007-01-24 12:33:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3275601, 454016, 30982, '<td valign="top">Obviously there aren''t enough crafty types at DPC - I know exactly what you were after with this.  Good clarity, good composition.  Might be just a tad lacking in contrast but not sure it could be increased on this particular shot without changing the lighting a bit.  What I think hurt you scorewise more than anything was the audience''s lack of familiarity with the subject matter.</td>', 'Obviously there aren''t enough crafty types at DPC - I know exactly what you were after with this.  Good clarity, good composition.  Might be just a tad lacking in contrast but not sure it could be increased on this particular shot without changing the lighting a bit.  What I think hurt you scorewise more than anything was the audience''s lack of familiarity with the subject matter.', '2007-01-24 12:38:12.000000', NULL, 0),
