(3281657, 453969, 55837, '<td valign="top">Great 1st entry.  Color is good and so is the composition.  Take what you have learned in this challenge and apply it to the next ones.  I am sure your scores will rise quickly.</td>', 'Great 1st entry.  Color is good and so is the composition.  Take what you have learned in this challenge and apply it to the next ones.  I am sure your scores will rise quickly.', '2007-01-25 14:52:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3281690, 450925, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice. Love the humour element in this. Score may have suffered a little, with some non-US folk unable to make a connection maybe? Oh well, nevermind, just keep those creative juices of yours flowing :)</td>', 'Nice. Love the humour element in this. Score may have suffered a little, with some non-US folk unable to make a connection maybe? Oh well, nevermind, just keep those creative juices of yours flowing :)', '2007-01-25 15:03:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3281893, 454063, 45475, '<td valign="top">Love the tones and the shallow dof is exceptional. Had I been online to vote and comment on this at the time, I would have likely given it an 8 or 9. There are some truly spectacular shots in this challenge, to be sure, but what grabs me here is the gritty, hard light feel to the processing. Definitely post work choices that make it stand out from the rest, imo. Congrats on a good score!</td>', 'Love the tones and the shallow dof is exceptional. Had I been online to vote and comment on this at the time, I would have likely given it an 8 or 9. There are some truly spectacular shots in this challenge, to be sure, but what grabs me here is the gritty, hard light feel to the processing. Definitely post work choices that make it stand out from the rest, imo. Congrats on a good score!', '2007-01-25 15:58:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3281895, 454334, 34938, '<td valign="top">should have been a ribbon winner Shannon...this is perfect and you are the expert at these type of shots...congrats on a high finish but you were underrated</td>', 'should have been a ribbon winner Shannon...this is perfect and you are the expert at these type of shots...congrats on a high finish but you were underrated', '2007-01-25 15:59:35.000000', NULL, 0),
