(3394746, 453336, 22301, '<td valign="top">wow this didn''t even break 6? I am pretty surprised, maybe you match wasn''t big enough :P. The only thing I can think to improve the shot isn''t necessarily a tighter crop but one where the subject is down more so there is some  black on the top and maybe move the subject only slighly to the middle so there is still lots of negative space. I like all the black :)</td>', 'wow this didn''t even break 6? I am pretty surprised, maybe you match wasn''t big enough :P. The only thing I can think to improve the shot isn''t necessarily a tighter crop but one where the subject is down more so there is some  black on the top and maybe move the subject only slighly to the middle so there is still lots of negative space. I like all the black :)', '2007-02-22 17:35:24.000000', NULL, 0),
